#: ../../../hwmon/sysfs-interface.rst:313
msgid ""
"Some chips measure temperature using external thermistors and an ADC, and "
"report the temperature measurement as a voltage. Converting this voltage "
"back to a temperature (or the other way around for limits) requires "
"mathematical functions not available in the kernel, so the conversion must "
"occur in user space. For these chips, all temp* files described above should "
"contain values expressed in millivolt instead of millidegree Celsius. In "
"other words, such temperature channels are handled as voltage channels by "
"the driver."
msgstr ""

